> **This extends Phases 1–4. Do not rebuild them.** Keep `.cursorrules`,
> `.cursorrules-design`, `.cursorrules-phase2`, `.cursorrules-phase3`,
> `.cursorrules-phase4`; add this as `.cursorrules-phase5` and tell Cursor to
> read all of them. Every earlier rule still applies unchanged — Golden Rules,
> the exact version pins, try/catch on every async call, no blank screens,
> no secrets in app code, plain language on top with the exact clinical term
