```
RLS: a user reads and writes only their own `bookings`; `lab_slots` is
world-readable to authenticated users, writable only by service role.
Extend `products` (the test catalog) with `prep_instructions TEXT`,
`fasting_required BOOLEAN`, `cycle_day_window TEXT`.

### 4.4 Integration
One adapter per provider behind a single interface, extending the existing
