## 12. FEATURE 10 — HEALTHY RECIPES  *(Wave D)*

- Attached to nutrition recommendations — a recipe is the answer to "what do I
  actually cook", so surface it from the recommendation, not only from a
  library tab.
- Full nutrition facts per serving, honest prep time, common ingredients.
- Filter by the dietary preferences and allergies already captured in the
  questionnaire — **allergen filtering is a safety feature**, and allergens
  are displayed on every recipe regardless of filter state.
- Save, note, and shopping-list generation. Shopping list may link to the
  store (§13) but must work fully without buying anything.
- Never claim a food prevents cancer. Ever.

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS public.recipes (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  slug TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
  title TEXT NOT NULL,
  prep_minutes INT, cook_minutes INT, servings INT,
  ingredients JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',
  steps JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',
  nutrition JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}',
  allergens JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',
  tags JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',
  image_url TEXT,
  status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'draft',
  reviewed_by UUID REFERENCES public.doctors(id),
  reviewed_at TIMESTAMPTZ
);
```

