## 18. THE POINT

Every feature here exists to answer one question a user is actually asking:
*"I know I'm worried — what do I do on Monday morning?"*

A feature that adds something to look at but nothing to do on Monday is not
ready. When in doubt, cut the feature and improve the next step.
